      <description><![CDATA[
<div class="cs-appcast-notes" style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2937;">
  <style>
    .cs-update-size-fallback { margin: 0 0 14px; }
